    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="61.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 61.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 þæt nan man ne wifige on neahsibban men þonne wiðutan þam IIII. cneowe; ne nan man on his godsibbe ne wifige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">and that any man should marry a nearly related person, [any nearer] than outside the fourth degree. And no man is to marry anyone spiritually related to him.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">and that any man shall marry anyone more closely related than the fourth degree; nor is any man to marry one spiritually related to him.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
